## Third-party: NDI SDK

`crates/broadcast` loads the NDI runtime (`Processing.NDI.Lib.x64.dll` /
`libndi.dylib` / `libndi.so`) at runtime via `libloading` — no NDI binaries,
headers, or import libraries are vendored in this repository, and none of
this project's license grants above extend to them.

The NDI SDK and its redistributable runtime are separate proprietary
software owned by Vizrt NDI AB (NewTek), governed by NewTek's NDI SDK
License Agreement (see https://ndi.video/for-developers/ndi-sdk/). Anyone
building or distributing this app is responsible for obtaining the NDI SDK
themselves and complying with its license terms, including any trademark
attribution requirements for "NDI®".
